      reason: The outlined box is a single checkbox labeled 'WITHIN 10 DAYS AFTER
        RECEIVING THE ADVANCE NOTICE;' — a boolean indicator specific to that option,
        not a category covering all three appeal timing options, so recipient_appealed_within_10_days_ind
