      changed:
      - type
      - description
      - -values
      - name
      reason: 'The widget is a single checkbox, one of three option boxes for the
        Goldberg Kelly question, so it cannot carry a 2-value category. Its tooltip
        identifies this box as the ''within 10 days after receiving the advance notice''
        option; typing it boolean with an option-specific name keeps it distinct from '
